  "runtime_scope": "8B/70B: 60..84 requests, outputs up to192; 400B:36..48 requests, outputs up to64. Both exceed32GPUs. 400B trace size is reduced for CPU cost, not simulated time compression. All tokens still execute in native ASTRA.",
  "rng": "SHA256(version|seed|family|stream) seeds independent Random streams: conditions, classes, shapes, outputs, arrivals. Model/network/split excluded; paired network request arrays identical.",
  "forecast_boundary": "Prior means and probability laws only. No realized counts, latent probabilities, exact epoch boundaries, future arrivals or EOS in callbacks.",
  "weighting": "Within each model and traffic pattern, pool each request type over the preselected seeds; average request types and traffic patterns. Overall = 75% of model mean + 25% of the lowest model score.",
